From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:09:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] overview: hooks for the Apex overview

Value and behaviour hooks for the overview of DESIGN.md, which the Apex
layer provides (apex-fedora ROADMAP S3a):

- WindowPreview: a value hook over the title's initial visibility, and
  one over the actors the overlay fades in and out, given the preview,
  through which the layer keeps titles shown;
- Workspace: a behaviour hook once the workspace is built, given its
  layout, through which the layer hides the background card and adds the
  empty-workspace label;
- ThumbnailsBox: value hooks over the maximum thumbnail scale and over
  the number of dynamic workspaces above which the thumbnails show;
- SearchController: a behaviour hook when text arrives in the search
  entry or the entry takes the key focus, given which of the two, the
  text and a reset, through which Spotlight takes over the overview's
  search.
- ControlsManagerLayout: a value hook over the height of the app grid's
  workspace strip, through which the layer gives the grid that space.
---
